<view class="page feature-page coupon-center"><brand-header back="{{true}}" title="领券中心"></brand-header><view class="pad"><view class="coupon-center-header"><view><view class="top-title">美丽礼遇，轻松领取</view><view class="sub-title">领取后可在“我的优惠券”查看</view></view><view class="coupon-header-icon"><ui-icon name="ticket" size="58"></ui-icon></view></view><view class="coupon-offer panel" wx:for="{{coupons}}" wx:key="id"><view class="coupon-offer-amount"><text>¥</text>{{item.amount}}</view><view class="coupon-offer-copy"><view>{{item.name}}</view><view class="card-note">{{item.rule}}</view><view class="card-note">领取后{{item.days}}天内有效</view></view><button class="coupon-claim {{item.claimed ? 'claimed' : ''}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="claim" disabled="{{item.claimed}}">{{item.claimed ? '已领取' : '立即领取'}}</button></view><button class="secondary-button coupon-mine" bindtap="mine">我的优惠券（{{claimedCount}}张）</button><view class="notice">当前为本地领券演示，每张优惠券只能领取一次，领取记录保存在当前设备。真实发券、适用范围及订单核销待接入后台。</view></view></view>
